# Config and env

Every new env var must be added in **all** of:

1. `src/core/config/config.types.ts` (`Config` interface)
2. `src/core/config/config.validation.ts` (Joi schema)
3. `.env.example`

Inject `@/core/config/config.service` (`ConfigService`). Do not read `process.env` in feature code (CLI `data-source.ts` is the exception).

```typescript
// ❌ BAD
const port = process.env.PORT;

// ✅ GOOD
const port = this.configService.get('PORT');
```

Do not introduce Zod for env or HTTP validation.
